# Plural database table names

In `service/organization-panel-service`, **all database table names must be plural** (English plural form).

## Rules

- JPA `@Table(name = "...")` must use the plural name (e.g. `organizations`, not `organization`).
- Liquibase `createTable.tableName` and related constraints must match the same plural name.
- Prefer snake_case plurals: `organizations`, `order_items`, `user_roles`.
- Entity class names stay singular (`Organization`); only the physical table is plural.
- Do not rely on Hibernate default naming; always set `@Table(name = "...")` explicitly.

## Examples

```java
// ❌ BAD
@Table(name = "organization")
public class Organization { }

// ✅ GOOD
@Table(name = "organizations")
public class Organization { }
```

```yaml
# ❌ BAD
tableName: organization

# ✅ GOOD
tableName: organizations
```
